OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque celebrates first petrol
OL,4,Afilling station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plaque marking the site of Britain's
OL,7,Ffirst petrol filling station has been
OL,8,Funveiled.
OL,10,FThe pioneering filling station on the
OL,11,FA4 Bath Road near Aldermaston Wharf in
OL,12,Fwest Berkshire was established by the
OL,13,FAutomobile Association (AA) and was
OL,14,Foperating by November 1919, with its
OL,15,Fofficial opening thought to have taken
OL,16,Fplace on 2 March 1920.
OL,18,FNow, a plaque has been unveiled close
OL,19,Fto the original site, and West
OL,20,FBerkshire Council hopes it will
OL,21,Fencourage people to learn more about
OL,22,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
