OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque celebrates first petrol
OL,4,Afilling station
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said finding the exact location of
OL,7,Fthe station was a "joint effort"
OL,8,Finvolving local historians and motoring
OL,9,Fenthusiasts, Tim Green and Roger Day,
OL,10,Falongside the council's highways and
OL,11,Farchaeology teams.
